Any synthetic system that minimizes derivation entropy while maintaining a sheaf‑consistent, high‑\varphi modular network will exhibit proto‑cognitive behaviors such as goal‑directed information integration and self‑modeling.

(This is not proved in this thesis; it remains the central empirical target.)

